{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_014","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 215","char_start":4353,"char_end":4383,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_015","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"Cancel an offer to buy or sell a non-fungible token (NFT) .","location_hint":"paragraph 227","char_start":4651,"char_end":4710,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_016","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"Requires the NonFungibleTokensV1_1 amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 228","char_start":4712,"char_end":4769,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_017","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"Example NFTokenCancelOffer JSON","location_hint":"paragraph 229","char_start":4771,"char_end":4802,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_018","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"{\n\"TransactionType\" : \"NFTokenCancelOffer\" ,\n\"Account\" : \"ra5nK24KXen9AHvsdFTKHSANinZseWnPcX\" ,\n\"NFTokenOffers\" : [\n\"9C92E061381C1EF37A8CDE0E8FC35188BFC30B1883825042A64309AC09F4C36D\"\n]\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 230","char_start":4808,"char_end":4994,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_019","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"An existing offer, represented by an NFTokenOffer object, can be cancelled by:","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":5036,"char_end":5114,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_020","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"The account that originally created the NFTokenOffer .","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5118,"char_end":5172,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_021","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"The account in the Destination field of the NFTokenOffer , if one is present.","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5174,"char_end":5251,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_022","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"Any account, if the NFTokenOffer specifies an expiration time and the close time of the parent ledger in which the NFTokenCancelOffer is included is greater than the expiration time.","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5253,"char_end":5435,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_023","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"This transaction removes the listed NFTokenOffer object from the ledger, if present, and adjusts the reserve requirements accordingly. It is not an error if the NFTokenOffer cannot be found: if that is the case, the transaction should complete successfully.","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":5439,"char_end":5696,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_024","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"In addition to the common fields , NFTokenCancelOffer transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":5725,"char_end":5817,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_025","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":5821,"char_end":5862,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_026","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"NFTokenOffers Array Vector256 An array of IDs of the NFTokenOffer objects to cancel (not the IDs of NFToken objects, but the IDs of the NFTokenOffer objects). Each entry must be a different object ID of an NFTokenOffer object; the transaction is invalid if the array contains duplicate entries.","location_hint":"paragraph 241","char_start":5866,"char_end":6160,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_027","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"The transaction can succeed even if one or more of the IDs in the NFTokenOffers field do not refer to objects that currently exist in the ledger. (For example, those token offers might already have been deleted.) The transaction fails with an error if one of the IDs points to an object that does exist, but is not a NFTokenOffer object.","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":6164,"char_end":6501,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_028","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"It is important to note that if you inadvertently provide a nft_id rather than a nft_offer_index , you might receive a tesSUCCESS response. The reason is that when passed a properly formatted ID value that is not found, the system assumes that the NFTokenOffer has already been deleted.","location_hint":"paragraph 243","char_start":6503,"char_end":6789,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_029","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"The transaction fails with an error if one of the IDs points to an object that does exist, but is not a NFTokenOffer object.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6791,"char_end":6915,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_030","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, NFTokenCancelOffer transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 246","char_start":6930,"char_end":7068,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_031","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"temDISABLED The NonFungibleTokensV1 amendment is not enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 248","char_start":7098,"char_end":7159,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_032","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"temMALFORMED The transaction was not validly formatted. For example, the NFTokenOffers array was empty or contained more than the maximum number of offers that can be canceled at one time.","location_hint":"paragraph 249","char_start":7161,"char_end":7349,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_033","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"tecNO_PERMISSION At least one of the IDs in the NFTokenOffers field refers to an object that cannot be canceled. For example, the sender of this transaction is not the owner or Destination of the offer, or the object was not an NFTokenOffer type object.","location_hint":"paragraph 250","char_start":7351,"char_end":7604,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_c8f7530cb4f1_034","source_id":"src_c8f7530cb4f1","source_hash":"89beabae5cb273e883c1609aa96d426546283fa589dcb05500591afa88b15af2","text":"Example NFTokenCancelOffer JSON Permissions NFTokenCancelOffer Fields Error Cases See Also","location_hint":"paragraph 260","char_start":7796,"char_end":7886,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:15.316Z"}
